 "body": "## Motivation\n\nStage 4.3 proof packet for issue #461 (see the issue body for targets, sources and plan).\n\n## Description\n\n- Merge remote-tracking branch 'github/main' into issue-461-weighted-line-collision\n- chore(telemetry): GitHub record snapshot\n- chore(telemetry): record combined review recovery\n- Merge pull request #476 from Dengnifer/issue-475-combined-native-review-recovery\n- fix(local): resume completed combined native reviews\n- Merge commit 'ef722919001258438a7a087361945ac5860ba1d8' into issue-461-weighted-line-collision\n- Add weighted line collision bound\n- Merge commit 'f15d0fc5721622360564b8083577dba1f02bfc04' into issue-461-weighted-line-collision\n- Add mixed line parameter resampling\n- Merge commit 'cc7c240d8effc507d936416b47137ba80c4995a9' into issue-452-mixed-line-resampling\n- Add diagonal line parameter resampling\n- feat(QPBT/Combining): prove axis line resampling\n- feat(QPBT/Combining): bound uniform affine collisions\n- Merge commit '1869f552389f462191c0be0b9ee080c9d1aa15de' into proof-uniform-affine-collision-20260909\n- Add coefficient polynomial collision bound\n- feat(QPBT/Combining): evaluate nondegenerate affine lines\n- feat(QPBT/Combining): recover combined point witness\n- feat(QPBT/Combining): recover sub-line witness\n- Merge commit '06df4fdd08659de173c9ac40b7ebe64a9b5fd46b' into issue-380-subline-witness\n- Merge commit 'd9be57dedd4ea3a3321943539f0785fde00f172d' into issue-380-subline-witness\n- feat(QPBT/Combining): prove restricted line mixture bounds\n- fix(QPBT/Combining): Prove restricted seed mass\n- fix(QPBT/Combining): Prove restricted seed mass\n\n## Testing\n\nWorker checked every changed file with `lake env lean`; exact-head CI and review follow.\n\n---\nCloses #461\n",
