 "body": "### Motivation\n- Supply the conditional collision hypothesis needed by the line-pasting step\n  in `lem:qld-xz-lines`, paper lines 950--963.\n- Close issue #489 using the published weighted-collision and normalization\n  APIs without adding a sampler or collision assumption.\n\n### Description\n- Add `nondegenerateLinePastingDist_collision_bound` in the dedicated\n  `Lines/ConditionalCollision.lean` leaf.\n- Derive each conditioned fiber estimate from the product weighted-collision\n  bound and positive retained mass.\n- Re-export the leaf from `MIPStarRE.QPBT.Combining.Lines`.\n\n### Testing\n- `lake build MIPStarRE.QPBT.Combining.Lines.ConditionalCollision`\n- `lake env lean MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/Lines/ConditionalCollision.lean`\n- `lake build MIPStarRE.QPBT.Combining.Lines`\n- Axiom audit: `propext`, `Classical.choice`, and `Quot.sound` only.\n- `scripts/install_git_hooks.sh --check`\n- `git diff --check`\n\n---\nCloses #489\n",
