 "body": "### Motivation\n\nIssue #505 removes retired admission machinery that could stall detached workers.\n\n### Description\n\nUse configured worker caps, live PID reservation markers, utilization ratios\nand ten-second polling. Preserve dispatch model selection, telemetry and needed\nresume affinity. Retired queue/native entrypoints reject execution.\n\n### Testing\n\nThe author passed 602 tests; nine historical queue tests were skipped. Commit\nhooks passed. The 966-line change is preserved; canonical CI and independent\nreview follow checked publication. Installed home commands remain with meta.\n\n---\nCloses #505\n",
